# fresh_dev_suspend_finish_then_pause_no_display: With no display page, pause and unpause after rvg_device_finish_suspend find no root FIFO and no guest display: nothing dies, unpause sets run state 0 and raises one interrupt, but no FIFO runs (0x1000 still reads 1) until the guest writes 0x1000 = 0 and enables the root FIFO again; its NOP then completes with an interrupt.
